    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENTATION</h2><br>This is a classic old-school 2D fantasy RPG.<br><br>A terrible disease knowns as the Spread roams freely through the world of Terra. What was once a land of peace and beauty is now a land torn between survival and pain.<br>Moira and her family are the only survivors of their village, in her attempt to flee the sickness by going to a safe haven, she loses her husband, becoming the sole responsible for her children's safety and life.<br><br>There is more tragedy coming her way that she could have ever imagined. Between making even more sacrifices and discovering a way to put an end to the disease while keeping her children alive, Moira will have to become someone far stronger than she thought she could ever be.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>10 to 20 hours of gameplay<br></li><li>A very free gaming experience<br></li><li>Explore the entirety of a world in ruins and discover hidden treasures, enemies and locations<br></li><li>Special weapons to be found<br></li><li>Optional dungeons to explore<br></li><li>Optional bosses to defeat<br></li><li>Mouse support<br></li><li>Autosave feature</li></ul>",
